---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CodeBlock from "../components/CodeBlock.astro";
import PaymentFlow from "../components/PaymentFlow.astro";
import { config } from "../lib/config";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Quickstart | CANIX402"
  description="Get an agent connected to Canix402 in four steps: read discovery and OpenAPI, probe free routes (including execution shapes and Haystack quotes), then call paid opportunities, positions, execution quotes, or swap transactions with x402 USDC payment."
  keywords="Canix402 quickstart, agent onboarding, x402 integration, discovery, OpenAPI, Algorand DeFi API"
>
  <h1 class="page-title">Quickstart</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    Use the Caddy gateway URL as your base URL. Discovery, OpenAPI,
    <code>GET /execution/shapes</code>, and <code>POST /swaps/quote</code> are free; paid data,
    quote, and swap-transaction routes require x402 USDC payment.
  </p>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Option A: Use MCP (recommended for agent hosts)</h2>
    <p>
      Connect your MCP client to <a href="/mcp">{config.mcpUrl}</a> (Streamable HTTP). Free tools
      wrap discovery and health; paid tools return payment requirements, then accept
      <code>paymentSignature</code> on retry. No mnemonic on the MCP server.
    </p>
    <CodeBlock
      code={`{
  "mcpServers": {
    "canix402": {
      "url": "${config.mcpUrl}"
    }
  }
}`}
    />
    <p class="muted">
      See <a href="/mcp">MCP documentation</a> for the full tool list and paid-tool flow.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>Option B: Direct HTTP</h2>
    <p>Read discovery and OpenAPI, then call paid routes with x402 headers as below.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>1. Read discovery</h2>
    <p>Fetch the machine-readable endpoint catalog and payment policy.</p>
    <CodeBlock code={`curl -s ${config.discoveryUrl} | jq`} />
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>2. Read OpenAPI</h2>
    <p>Use OpenAPI for detailed schemas, query params, and x402 metadata.</p>
    <CodeBlock code={`curl -s ${config.openApiUrl} | jq '.paths | keys'`} />
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>3. Probe free routes</h2>
    <p>
      Health, metadata, <code>GET /execution/shapes</code>, and
      <code>POST /swaps/quote</code> should return <code>200</code> without payment headers.
    </p>
    <CodeBlock
      code={`curl -i ${config.gatewayBaseUrl}/health\ncurl -i ${config.gatewayBaseUrl}/metadata\ncurl -i ${config.gatewayBaseUrl}/execution/shapes\ncurl -i ${config.gatewayBaseUrl}/swaps/quote \\\n  -H 'content-type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{"address":"YOUR_ALGORAND_ADDRESS","fromAssetId":0,"toAssetId":31566704,"amount":"1000000","type":"fixed-input"}'`}
    />
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>4. Call a paid route</h2>
    <p>
      First call returns <code>402</code> with <code>PAYMENT-REQUIRED</code>. Retry with a signed
      payload. Same pattern for opportunities, positions, execution quotes, and Haystack
      <code>POST /swaps/transactions</code>.
    </p>
    <PaymentFlow />
    <CodeBlock
      code={`# Opportunities\ncurl -i ${config.gatewayBaseUrl}/opportunities\ncurl -i ${config.gatewayBaseUrl}/opportunities \\\n  -H 'PAYMENT-SIGNATURE: <base64-json-payload>'\n\n# Positions\ncurl -i '${config.gatewayBaseUrl}/positions?address=YOUR_ALGORAND_ADDRESS'\ncurl -i '${config.gatewayBaseUrl}/positions?address=YOUR_ALGORAND_ADDRESS' \\\n  -H 'PAYMENT-SIGNATURE: <base64-json-payload>'\n\n# Execution quotes (see /examples for full bodies)\ncurl -i ${config.gatewayBaseUrl}/execution/quotes \\\n  -H 'content-type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{"quotes":[{"shapeKey":"mainnet:tinyman:v2:addLiquidity:flexible","input":{"userAddress":"YOUR_ALGORAND_ADDRESS","assetAId":0,"assetAAmount":"1000000","assetBId":31566704,"assetBAmount":"1000000","maxSlippageBps":50}}]}'\n\n# Swap transactions (after free quote + opt-in)\ncurl -i ${config.gatewayBaseUrl}/swaps/transactions \\\n  -H 'content-type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{"address":"YOUR_ALGORAND_ADDRESS","quote":{/* fresh quote */},"slippage":0.005}'`}
    />
    <p class="muted">
      Full copy-paste flows for quotes, positions, and swaps:
      <a href="/examples">examples</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
